"Moon Thegund's chaos index rose for months and hit its limit weeks before the outbreak."
"Yipalck evacuated its own staff by ship; Worli Ro-den's loyal assistants were left behind."
"A demon bug swarm struck the Elepta farm and its region, a red zone at the center of the map."
"Moon Thegund's System failed entirely, cutting teleports and calls for everyone."
"Most non-Avowed caught in the red zone died; Thenn-ar and several scientists were killed."
"Alden Thorn and the child Kibby survived in Ro-den's lab, sheltering in a runed vault."
"The Systems officially class it a Thegund Class corrupted environment."
"The Contracts estimated capable rescue would take 8 to 14 months to reach Elepta."
"Wizard ships from the Mother clear chaos zones slowly, two steps forward and one back."
"On about day 152 a cleared half-circle appeared at the far edge of the chaos map."
